    "previews, provisions, or diagnoses a uv-managed local python .venv with `databricks environments setup-local`. use when the user wants to set up or fix one for databricks connect, cluster or serverless compute, `--job-task`, or a bundle target, or when setup-local fails.": "Создание и диагностика локального виртуального окружения Python (`.venv` под управлением `uv`) с помощью `databricks environments setup-local` для работы с Databricks Connect.",
    "use when querying or calling pay-per-token foundation models, or when creating, updating, listing, or querying unity gateway (also called unity ai gateway) services, including model provider services, mcp services, system.ai services, and three-part unity catalog service names (catalog.schema.service). also use for managing spend budgets and usage alerts on unity gateway, and for migrating from legacy ai gateway. also use when a workload with model serving endpoint permissions (for example can_query) gets permission_denied querying a three-part model name, since serving-endpoint access does not grant access to a unity gateway service. not for configuring legacy ai gateway on model serving endpoints; use databricks-model-serving for that.": "Работа с сервисами Unity AI Gateway: вызов фундаментальных моделей с оплатой за токены, создание и настройка сервисов провайдеров моделей и MCP-сервисов в Unity Catalog, управление бюджетами расходов и лимитами.",
